# The end of the GDI campaign, with the last mission won by the developers'
# Alt-W: the score, the hall of fame, the picture that announces the next
# game, and the main menu. The movies between them are off.
# args: -PLAYTEST -NEWGAMESCG15EA
at 300 keydown ALT
at 301 key W
at 305 keyup ALT
at 3000 shot hall_of_fame
at 3001 type AB
at 3020 key RETURN
at 3200 shot coming_attraction
at 3800 shot main_menu
at 3801 quit
